{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人鄭丹瑞有兩女，大女鄭瑤（Zaneta）和細女鄭珉（Amanda）。</p><p>大女鄭瑤在2024年已成為人妻，並於2026年3月誕下一女，鄭丹瑞亦正式榮升外公。</p><p>昨晚（2日）鄭珉無預警下低調宣布結婚，她透過社交平台發出貼文，以英文巧妙地用電腦系統升級</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:22:54.607030+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:01:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:18:22.038253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:18:22.038253+00:00","content_hash":"85b878efb75a61812f76b1e529272a609a2476fe4090b5e8732be43e8e40dc4f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}